<item><title>Ruto and Mnangagwa open presidential commission on Kenya-Zimbabwe ties</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/ruto-and-mnangagwa-open-presidential-commission-on-kenya-9b095c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/ruto-and-mnangagwa-open-presidential-commission-on-kenya-9b095c/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>The leaders are due to review existing agreements and trade barriers, with Kenya targeting US$70 million in annual bilateral trade.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:55:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Kenyan court bars Ebola centre work and orders US deal disclosure</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenyan-court-bars-ebola-centre-work-and-orders-us-deal-40571d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenyan-court-bars-ebola-centre-work-and-orders-us-deal-40571d/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>Justice Patricia Nyaundi ruled that the government breached the Constitution by allowing the 50-bed facility to be built without public participation.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:52:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenyan-court-bars-ebola-centre-work-and-orders-us-deal-40571d/share.jpg" length="42716" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenyan-court-bars-ebola-centre-work-and-orders-us-deal-40571d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
